{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25000","headline":"寄永平友人 一 · 牟融","name":"寄永平友人 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"故人千里隔天涯，几度临风动远思。\n贾谊上书曾伏阙，仲舒陈策欲匡时。\n高风落落谁同调，往事悠悠我独悲。\n何日归来话畴昔，一樽重叙旧襟期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"牟融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25000.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25000","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}